    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations on your new position at the town hall. The Mayor and her colleagues are very pleased to meet you. They hope you are ready for puzzles and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/ffcf9be41922093dee7ac8e03bea621d.poster.avif?t=1745919871\" width=800 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/ffcf9be41922093dee7ac8e03bea621d.webm?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/ffcf9be41922093dee7ac8e03bea621d.mp4?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mayor's secretary Escape Game&quot; is an escape game for virtual reality (VR) and PC (non-VR). Solve the puzzles, search the rooms, investigate the places and, if you wish, live the story and its implications fully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/847c118c3229836a6756a99da03d348d.poster.avif?t=1745919871\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/847c118c3229836a6756a99da03d348d.webm?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/847c118c3229836a6756a99da03d348d.mp4?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   \u25a0  A town hall containing 6 rooms full of puzzles to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0  Fun mechanics and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0  Multiplayer up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   \u25a0  An immersive story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0  Save system to take breaks during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0  Hint system to get help if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/83a30bd920b6f9e636dc3b854a62c329.poster.avif?t=1745919871\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/83a30bd920b6f9e636dc3b854a62c329.webm?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/83a30bd920b6f9e636dc3b854a62c329.mp4?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR and non VR:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the game in VR, the game supports full room-scale/standing tracking on both the HTC Vive and Oculus Rift with SteamVR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the game in non-VR, the gameplay has been designed so the players on PC get a similar experience to players in Virtual Reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/94099dee011563c1ff78edd01c4eb133.poster.avif?t=1745919871\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/94099dee011563c1ff78edd01c4eb133.webm?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/94099dee011563c1ff78edd01c4eb133.mp4?t=1745919871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think you are up for the task ? The city sure hope your brain is ready !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598470/extras/a9f2ce4436a86511ec8647ab0168e243.avif?t=1745919871\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
